OL,3,W"###"###"###T//-,.,,-,.-/.-//,,.,.,.-//
OL,4,CGraffiti from the past found during    
OL,5,Crestoration                            
OL,6,GGraffiti dating back more than 250     
OL,7,Gyears has been uncovered during        
OL,8,Grestoration work in what is thought to 
OL,9,Gbe Europe's oldest residential street. 
OL,11,FThe markings were discovered on the    
OL,12,Froof of a tower at Vicars' Close in    
OL,13,FWells, Somerset.                       
OL,15,FThe homes date back to the 14th        
OL,16,FCentury and were built to provide      
OL,17,Faccommodation at Wells Cathedral. The  
OL,18,Fgraffiti includes initials, decorative 
OL,19,Fpatterns and the outline of a foot     
OL,20,Fdating back to the 1780s.              
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
