OL,3,W"###"###"###T//-,.,,-,.-/.-//,,.,.,.-//
OL,4,CCommunity hits minimum target to save  
OL,5,Cvillage pub                            
OL,6,GA campaign group says it has reached   
OL,7,Gits minimum target of #300,000 to help 
OL,8,Gbring a pub into community ownership.  
OL,10,FThe Stags Hunt pub in Ponsanooth       
OL,11,Fclosed in January 2025. Sam Fitch,     
OL,12,Fchair of the Save the Stag campaign,   
OL,13,Fsaid saving the pub was important      
OL,14,Fbecause it was "heart of the village". 
OL,16,FHe said the money was raised through a 
OL,17,Fcommunity share offer, which could     
OL,18,Fonly run for 12 months, and two days   
OL,19,Fbefore the deadline they had reached   
OL,20,Ftheir minimum target.                  
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
