OL,3,W"###"###"###T//-,.,,-,.-/.-//,,.,.,.-//
OL,4,C'My frustrating 10-year wait for       
OL,5,Carthritis diagnosis'                   
OL,6,GA woman said a decade-long wait to get 
OL,7,Gdiagnosed with a painful inflammatory  
OL,8,Garthritis left her frustrated and, at  
OL,9,Gtimes, unable to walk.                 
OL,11,FClare Base, who is in her 40s, from    
OL,12,FPortishead, said she lived with        
OL,13,Fpersistent pain which caused mobility  
OL,14,Fissues and sleeplessness before she    
OL,15,Fwas diagnosed with ankylosing          
OL,16,Fspondylitis, a form of axial           
OL,17,Fspondyloarthritis (axSpA).             
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
